                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                      *        
*  PROGRAM    :  W4130500                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  SKAPAR LISTA PA HUR MANGA RADER VARJE                 *        
*                PLOCKARE I DC 4X HAR PACKAT VARJE DAG                 *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  MÅNS SAMUELSSON                                       *        
*                                                                      *        
*  ÄNDRING    :                                                        *        
*                                                                      *        
*     DATUM       NAMN                     AVDELNING                   *        
*     ......      ..................       ......                      *        
*     ......      ..................       ......                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W41305D1                                                                   
*                                                                               
%WDQ301                                                                         
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W41305D2  PRINTER FB (81 0)                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W41305D3  PRINTER FB (81 0)                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W41305D4  PRINTER FB (81 0)                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE TEMPFIL   FB (24 0)                                                        
*                                                                               
  T1-IDUSER                1  8 N                                               
  T1-KVPACKRAD-OD          9  7 N                                               
  T1-KVPACKRAD-OD-O        16 7 N                                               
  T1-IDDC                  23 2 A                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
FILE W41305D6  VB (28 0)                                                        
*                                                                               
  UT-IDUSER                1  8 N                                               
  UT-KVPACKRAD-OD          9  7 N                                               
  UT-KVPACKRAD-OD-O        16 7 N                                               
  UT-IDDC                  23 2 A                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
                                                                                
IX            W  9 N   VALUE  1                                                 
W-IDUSER      W  8 N MASK 'ZZZZZZZ9' HEADING 'PICKER'                           
WS-IDUSER     W  8 N MASK 'ZZZZZZZ9'                                            
W-IDDC        W  2 A                                                            
W-TIAAMMDD    W  6 N                                                            
W-TIAA W-TIAAMMDD 2 N                                                           
W-TIMM W-TIAAMMDD +2 2 N                                                        
W-TIDD W-TIAAMMDD +4 2 N                                                        
                                                                                
***     VALID IDDC CODES                                                        
%WWDC99                                                                         
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
                                                                                
W-DATUM-Y2K   W  8  N                                                           
W-SEKEL-Y2K   W-DATUM-Y2K     2  N                                              
W-AAMMDD-Y2K  W-DATUM-Y2K +2  6  N                                              
                                                                                
W-KVPACKRAD-OD W 7 N 0 HEADING 'LINES PACKED'                                   
W-KVPACKRAD-OD-O W 7 N 0 HEADING 'LINES PACKED RFS NOT TODAY'                   
PROGRAMNAMN   W  6 A VALUE 'W41305'                                             
NEWPAGE                                                                         
%WDATKORT 'RC2'                                                                 
                                                                                
*    -- CHECKED BY WY2000                                                       
*                                                                               
* STEG 1. SKAPAR LISTA                                                          
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT W41305D1 START A-INIT                                                 
  PERFORM S23-CHECK-ODEL-IDDC                                                   
  IF ODEL-IDDC = NDC-US                                                         
    IF ODEL-TIPACKN = W-TIAAMMDD                                                
      IF ODEL-IDUSER NUMERIC                                                    
        MOVE ODEL-IDUSER TO W-IDUSER                                            
        MOVE ODEL-IDUSER TO WS-IDUSER                                           
      ELSE                                                                      
        W-IDUSER = 0                                                            
        WS-IDUSER = 0                                                           
        DISPLAY 'USER = ' ODEL-IDUSER ' LINES = ' ODEL-KVPACKRAD-OD             
      END-IF                                                                    
      IF ODEL-DARFSDAT = W-DATUM-Y2K                                            
        W-KVPACKRAD-OD = ODEL-KVPACKRAD-OD                                      
        W-KVPACKRAD-OD-O = 0                                                    
      ELSE                                                                      
        W-KVPACKRAD-OD-O = ODEL-KVPACKRAD-OD                                    
        W-KVPACKRAD-OD = 0                                                      
      END-IF                                                                    
      IF ODEL-IDDC = NDC-US-RU                                                  
*       T1-IDDC = '41'                                                          
        T1-IDDC = NDC-US-RU                                                     
        T1-IDUSER = W-IDUSER                                                    
        T1-KVPACKRAD-OD = W-KVPACKRAD-OD                                        
        T1-KVPACKRAD-OD-O = W-KVPACKRAD-OD-O                                    
        PUT TEMPFIL                                                             
        PRINT LISTA1                                                            
      ELSE                                                                      
*       IF ODEL-IDDC = NDC-US-AT                                                
*         T1-IDDC = '42'                                                        
*         T1-IDDC = NDC-US-AT                                                   
*         T1-IDUSER = W-IDUSER                                                  
*         T1-KVPACKRAD-OD = W-KVPACKRAD-OD                                      
*         T1-KVPACKRAD-OD-O = W-KVPACKRAD-OD-O                                  
*         PUT TEMPFIL                                                           
*         PRINT LISTA2                                                          
*       ELSE                                                                    
          IF ODEL-IDDC = NDC-US-LA                                              
*           T1-IDDC = '43'                                                      
            T1-IDDC = NDC-US-LA                                                 
            T1-IDUSER = W-IDUSER                                                
            T1-KVPACKRAD-OD = W-KVPACKRAD-OD                                    
            T1-KVPACKRAD-OD-O = W-KVPACKRAD-OD-O                                
            PUT TEMPFIL                                                         
            PRINT LISTA3                                                        
          END-IF                                                                
*       END-IF                                                                  
      END-IF                                                                    
    END-IF                                                                      
  END-IF                                                                        
*                                                                               
A-INIT. PROC                                                                    
  CALL DATKORT USING (PROGRAMNAMN '000001' RC2DATUMKORT)                        
  W-TIAA = RC2D-AAR                                                             
  W-TIMM = RC2D-MAANAD                                                          
  W-TIDD = RC2D-DAG                                                             
  W-AAMMDD-Y2K = W-TIAAMMDD                                                     
  IF W-TIAA < 50                                                                
    W-SEKEL-Y2K = 20                                                            
  ELSE                                                                          
    W-SEKEL-Y2K = 19                                                            
  END-IF                                                                        
  DISPLAY W-TIAAMMDD ' DETTA AER DATUMET'                                       
END-PROC                                                                        
*                                                                               
*  ---  S23-CHECK-ODEL-IDDC (MACRO PROCEDURE)                                   
%WWDC02 'ODEL-'                                                                 
*                                                                               
REPORT LISTA1 LINESIZE 80 SPACE 3 SUMMARY PRINTER W41305D2 NODATE               
  SEQUENCE W-IDUSER                                                             
  CONTROL W-IDUSER                                                              
  TITLE 'W41305-001   NO. OF LINES / PICKER DATE ' W-TIAAMMDD                   
  LINE W-IDUSER W-KVPACKRAD-OD W-KVPACKRAD-OD-O                                 
*                                                                               
REPORT LISTA2 LINESIZE 80 SPACE 3 SUMMARY PRINTER W41305D3 NODATE               
  SEQUENCE W-IDUSER                                                             
  CONTROL W-IDUSER                                                              
  TITLE 'W41305-001   NO. OF LINES / PICKER DATE ' W-TIAAMMDD                   
  LINE W-IDUSER W-KVPACKRAD-OD W-KVPACKRAD-OD-O                                 
*                                                                               
REPORT LISTA3 LINESIZE 80 SPACE 3 SUMMARY PRINTER W41305D4 NODATE               
  SEQUENCE W-IDUSER                                                             
  CONTROL W-IDUSER                                                              
  TITLE 'W41305-001   NO. OF LINES / PICKER DATE ' W-TIAAMMDD                   
  LINE W-IDUSER W-KVPACKRAD-OD W-KVPACKRAD-OD-O                                 
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
SORT TEMPFIL TO TEMPFIL USING (T1-IDDC T1-IDUSER)                               
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT TEMPFIL  FINISH Z-FIN                                                 
  IF T1-IDDC = W-IDDC AND T1-IDUSER = WS-IDUSER                                 
    UT-KVPACKRAD-OD      = UT-KVPACKRAD-OD   + T1-KVPACKRAD-OD                  
    UT-KVPACKRAD-OD-O    = UT-KVPACKRAD-OD-O + T1-KVPACKRAD-OD-O                
  ELSE                                                                          
    IF RECORD-COUNT =  1                                                        
    ELSE                                                                        
      PUT W41305D6                                                              
    END-IF                                                                      
    UT-IDDC              = T1-IDDC                                              
    UT-IDUSER            = T1-IDUSER                                            
    UT-KVPACKRAD-OD      = T1-KVPACKRAD-OD                                      
    UT-KVPACKRAD-OD-O    = T1-KVPACKRAD-OD-O                                    
    W-IDDC               = T1-IDDC                                              
    WS-IDUSER            = T1-IDUSER                                            
  END-IF                                                                        
                                                                                
Z-FIN. PROC                                                                     
  PUT W41305D6                                                                  
END-PROC                                                                        
